  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 404.06 Website. Each ELEC and ILEC shall post the rates, fares, charges, prices, terms, and conditions of all voice services on its publicly available website.\n\nSource. #14015, eff 7-1-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 400)",
